# Tainted Treats ({1}{B}{G}): "Destroy target artifact or creature. If its mana value was 4 or less, create a Food token." Bot2 builds five Moxen and a Sol Ring
# and casts a Catacomb Crocodile (mana value 5) on turn 2, a Phantom Monster (mana value 4) and a Darksteel Citadel (an indestructible artifact land, mana value 0) on
# turn 4. Bot1 destroys the Crocodile on turn 3 (no Food, the value being over 4), the Phantom Monster on turn 5 (a Food, the value being exactly 4) and
# targets the Citadel on turn 7: it is not destroyed, yet the Food is still created.

